{
    "title": "DIKIDI Online",
    "description": "DIKIDI Online is a simple and convenient way to book online for services to your favorite specialist or company. You can schedule an appointment at any time suitable for you.\r\n\r\nDIKIDI Online is\r\n\r\n1. ONLINE BOOKING\r\nNow you don\u2019t need to call or write to anyone, you will be able to select a master, a service and the right time for making your appointment, as all companies and specialists maintain an up-to-date schedule.\r\n\r\n2. CONVENIENT SEARCH BY:\r\n- map\r\n- service categories\r\n- ratings\r\n- services\r\n- prices, etc.\r\n\r\n3. SPECIAL OFFERS\r\nFind and use great deals of companies and specialists.\r\n\r\n4. APPOINTMENT MANAGEMENT\r\nBook appointments, edit them and cancel your visits.\r\n\r\n5. COMPANY CARD\r\nEach service provider has a company card with detailed information: address, work schedule, services and cost, interior photos and work examples, ratings and reviews.\r\n\r\n6. PHOTO GALLERY\r\nGet acquainted with a specialist work portfolio in his own photo gallery.\r\n\r\n7. BONUSES\r\nGet bonuses, discounts, cashback and gift cards.\r\n\r\n8. VISIT REMINDERS\r\nReminders will help you not to forget about the upcoming visit and arrive on time.\r\n\r\n9. CHATS\r\nCommunicate via chat with a company or a specialist before, during and after your appointment.\r\n\r\n10. REVIEWS\r\nView and add reviews.\r\n\r\nThe app has a lot of instruments for CONVENIENT and QUALITY ONLINE BOOKING to your favorite company, to the best specialists.\r\n\r\nDIKIDI Online - online booking is always at hand!",
    "descriptionHTML": "DIKIDI Online is a simple and convenient way to book online for services to your favorite specialist or company. You can schedule an appointment at any time suitable for you.<br><br>DIKIDI Online is<br><br>1. ONLINE BOOKING<br>Now you don\u2019t need to call or write to anyone, you will be able to select a master, a service and the right time for making your appointment, as all companies and specialists maintain an up-to-date schedule.<br><br>2. CONVENIENT SEARCH BY:<br>- map<br>- service categories<br>- ratings<br>- services<br>- prices, etc.<br><br>3. SPECIAL OFFERS<br>Find and use great deals of companies and specialists.<br><br>4. APPOINTMENT MANAGEMENT<br>Book appointments, edit them and cancel your visits.<br><br>5. COMPANY CARD<br>Each service provider has a company card with detailed information: address, work schedule, services and cost, interior photos and work examples, ratings and reviews.<br><br>6. PHOTO GALLERY<br>Get acquainted with a specialist work portfolio in his own photo gallery.<br><br>7. BONUSES<br>Get bonuses, discounts, cashback and gift cards.<br><br>8. VISIT REMINDERS<br>Reminders will help you not to forget about the upcoming visit and arrive on time.<br><br>9. CHATS<br>Communicate via chat with a company or a specialist before, during and after your appointment.<br><br>10. REVIEWS<br>View and add reviews.<br><br>The app has a lot of instruments for CONVENIENT and QUALITY ONLINE BOOKING to your favorite company, to the best specialists.<br><br>DIKIDI Online - online booking is always at hand!",
